{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/planarLayout()"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A crossing-free straight-line drawing on an integer grid, or nil when the graph is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"planar.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"name":"GraphDrawing","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE12planarLayoutAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSgyF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"planarLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"planarLayout()","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PlanarLayout.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/PlanarLayout.swift#L31"}},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"planarLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The drawing, in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, or nil when the graph has no planar embedding.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The drawing comes from ","type":"text"},{"code":"planarEmbedding()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by de Fraysseix, Pach and Pollack’s shift method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in Chrobak and Payne’s linear-time form. The embedding of the underlying simple graph","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(self-loops and parallel copies drawn as one segment) is first made connected, by an edge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the first vertex of each component to the first vertex of the next, and every face","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"boundary a simple cycle; then every face but the largest (the outer face) is triangulated.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The vertices are placed in a canonical ordering of that graph, each one above the contour","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of those before it, the contour shifted to make room. The added edges are not drawn and not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported. Every vertex has integer coordinates with 0 ≤ x ≤ 2n − 4 and 0 ≤ y ≤ n − 2, and no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two edges cross or overlap. Fewer than four vertices are placed at (0, 0), (2, 0) and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(1, 1) in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order. The drawing is not rescaled (","type":"text"},{"code":"rescaled(scale:center:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" maps it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a common frame). A directed graph is drawn through ","type":"text"},{"code":"undirectedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"de Fraysseix, Pach and Pollack, “How to draw a planar graph on a grid”, Combinatorica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"10(1), 1990."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Chrobak and Payne, “A linear-time algorithm for drawing a planar graph on a grid”,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Information Processing Letters 54(4), 1995.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n + m) for the embedding, then O(n) expected (hashing the triangulation’s vertex pairs).","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As for ","type":"text"},{"code":"planarEmbedding()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Precondition","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/planarlayout()"]}],"references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/Drawing":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/drawing","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Drawing","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Drawing","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A position in the plane for each vertex, in a fixed vertex order: what every layout in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"module returns, and what a caller passes as a starting drawing."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/planarLayout()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"planarLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"title":"planarLayout()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A crossing-free straight-line drawing on an integer grid, or nil when the graph is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"planar."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/planarLayout()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/planarlayout()"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","kind":"symbol","title":"GraphDrawing","abstract":[]},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","title":"Vertex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols":{"title":"GraphProtocols","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph":{"fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","text":"Graph","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Graph","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Graph","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph"}}}